        <body>
            <div xml:id="d403">

                <pb facs="1042" n="1010" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v10/pg1010"/>

                <head>403. Memorandum From the Deputy Secretary of Defense (Gilpatric) to President Kennedy<anchor n="0" xml:id="d403-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1962-09-01">September 1,
                        1962</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Cuba</item>
                </list>
                <p>Attached are answers prepared by the Joint Staff to a series of questions which I
                    put to them yesterday after our telephone conversation.</p>
                <p>By the time of your return Tuesday,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d403-f2"/> Defense and
                    the CIA will be prepared to give you an analysis
                    of the recently acquired intelligence on Cuba, and we will also have ready for
                    submission to you a proposal for further intelligence.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Roswell
                                Gilpatric</hi></signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d403-a1.xml" xpointer="d403-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d403-a2.xml" xpointer="d403-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d403-f1" n="0" type="source" xml:id="d403-f1-content">
