                    Files, Meetings and Memoranda Series, NSAM 181,
                    Cuba (B). Top Secret; Noforn; Special
                    Handling. Copies were sent to Rusk and
                        Kaysen.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d403-f2" n="1" xml:id="d403-f2-content">
